<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$70 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$70 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Promissory note issuers came to the Australian commercial market for a total A$70 million via tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>West Australia's Keystart made the largest issue on the day, selling A$50 million of its December 20-dated paper at about six points over the mid-rate for the nearest corresponding bank bill.</p>
